  "legacy_notes": "Pre-v2 ablation_matrix.json used a dict-keyed `matrix` field instead of a `variants` array. The dict included a `simple` entry with no corresponding yml under Exp/options/train/ and its metrics were null; it has been dropped from the v2 `variants` array and preserved in `legacy_matrix` for audit. A new variant `gated_flicker_color` (present as yml but absent from the legacy matrix) was added with metrics=null to restore Exp↔matrix parity.",
  "key_findings": [
    "A 单独贡献: +1.03 dB (local vs base)",
    "B 单独贡献: +0.74 dB (flicker vs base)",
    "A+B max 融合有害: ab(25.13) < local(26.01)，max 放大误检测",
    "CNN fusion (C) 拯救 A+B 组合: full(26.60) = +1.47 dB vs ab(25.13)",
    "最优组合: A+B+C with max+CNN fusion (full), PSNR=26.60"
  ]
}
